From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 20:32:41 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] AMLUtils: map the output colours on the picture, not the
 stream

On the FFmpeg path the demuxer wrote the output colours of a mapping
over single-layer streams, and VideoPlayer rewrote the HDR type of each
video hint. Inputstream and dual-layer streams kept their colours. Dolby
Vision sources under hdr2sdr kept PQ although the output is SDR. The PGS,
the VP9 decoder config and the fallback decoders took the output values.
